摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Read-only Git Graph sidebar for DeepSeek Harness Web: commit history, file diffs, two-commit comparison and full historical source. DSH 原生侧栏 Git 可视化插件。","id":"gh:1334848871","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-git-graph","slug":"WhitePlusMS/dsh-git-graph","topics":["commit-graph","deepseek-harness","diff-viewer","dsh","dsh-plugin","git-graph","git-history","git-visualization"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Read-only Git Graph sidebar for DeepSeek Harness Web: commit history, file diffs, two-commit compari"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"son and full historical source. DSH 原生侧栏 Git 可视化插件。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Version 0.6.1 · DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 · MIT"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文说明 · Static title"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"# dsh-git-graph"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"dsh-git-graph by **WhitePlusMS** is a read-only Git visualization plugin for the native right sideba"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"r of **DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web**. Browse your workspace's commit history, branches, and file chan"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ges without an API key or conversation message."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Quick facts**"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Item | Value |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Plugin name | `dsh-git-graph` (repository and DSH bundle row id) |\n| Repository | https://github.c"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"om/WhitePlusMS/dsh-git-graph |\n| Install source | GitHub Release archive (`dsh-git-graph-0.6.1.tgz`)"},{"id":"p8s3","text":", **not** npm |\n| Requires | DSH **0.2.1-rc.5**, `dsh` CLI, pnpm, Git on the DSH Host |\n| Operations"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" | Read-only — no stage, commit, push, pull, fetch, merge, or tag |\n| Languages and license | Chines"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"e / English UI · MIT |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Install · Usage · Keyboard controls · FAQ · Scope · Uninstall · Documentation"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The GIFs were recorded with 0.4.0; the comparison and full-source screenshots below are from 0.5.0. "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"They show earlier versions. The new branch navigation, dropdown controls, and dynamic graph alignmen"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"t in 0.6.0 were checked in real DSH; see the fix and validation record."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"More screenshots: commit comparison, full source, English, and narrow screens"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## What's new in 0.6.1"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- Update the DSH runtime and peer dependencies to **0.2.1-rc.5** and Cordis to **4.0.5**. This relea"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"se targets that runtime. Restart DSH after updating."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## What's new in 0.6.0"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- Select a local or remote branch to focus its history and locate its tip, without checking it out. "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"Branches, filters, and settings open from the top bar as dropdowns.\n- Keep graph nodes aligned while"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" commit details, file diffs, and uncommitted changes expand or collapse. Cancel obsolete reads when "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"switching or closing views; load tag/stash metadata only when opened.\n- Show when search stops at it"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"s 2,000-commit budget, preserve comma-containing references, use native Git branch patterns, and inc"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"lude file type changes. Root and subdirectory sessions share repository settings."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"See the 0.6.0 release notes for fixes and upgrade details."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- **History** — Commit topology, branches, tags, HEAD, search, and history filters.\n- **Branch navig"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ation** — Search local/remote branches in the branch dropdown, focus one branch, and locate its late"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"st commit without changing the working tree.\n- **Commit details** — Inline details with author/commi"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"tter dates, parents, references, signature status, and copying.\n- **References** — Every reference o"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"n a commit is shown; matching local/remote labels combine, chips wrap onto another line, and the row"},{"id":"p18s6","text":" height follows. Two alternative layouts remain.\n- **File changes** — File tree/list views, per-file"},{"id":"p18s7","text":" diffs, and uncommitted changes; select two commits and open each changed file's diff.\n- **Historica"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"l source** — Read and copy the complete text of an old or new file version, with its path, commit ha"},{"id":"p18s9","text":"sh, line numbers, and size.\n- **Messages & authors** — Commit messages with links, bold, italic, and"},{"id":"p18s10","text":" inline code; real author avatars from GitHub, Gravatar, and the repository's own Git service (Gitea"},{"id":"p18s11","text":"/Gogs).\n- **Display settings** — Resizable columns, date display options, compact rows, line styles,"},{"id":"p18s12","text":" and colour presets, saved per repository.\n- **Interface** — Chinese/English, light/dark themes, pan"},{"id":"p18s13","text":"e fullscreen, and narrow-screen support."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Commit details and file diffs**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**Commit comparison and uncommitted changes**"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Install or update"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Requires DSH **0.2.1-rc.5**, the `dsh` CLI, pnpm for plugin installation, and Git installed on the D"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" DSH **0.2.1-rc.5**, the `dsh` CLI, pnpm for plugin installation, and Git installed on the DSH Host."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Install the prebuilt `v0.6.1` Release package through either DSH's plugin page or the CLI. Both acce"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"pt the same package source. See the official plugin manager guide and packaging guide."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"In DSH, open **Plugins → Add plugin**, paste this URL, install it, and choose **Enable now**:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Or install from the terminal:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The archive includes the built `lib/` entry points. You do not need to clone this repository, build "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"it locally, or keep a development folder at a fixed path."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"This `.tgz` is built with `pnpm pack` and uploaded as a GitHub Release asset; it is separate from Gi"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"tHub's automatically generated source archives. DSH supports installing this package URL in both the"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" UI and CLI. Publishing a release does not automatically list the plugin in a marketplace; installin"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"g by package name alone requires an npm publication."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"> **Name note.** The npm package named `dsh-git-graph` is a **different, unrelated plugin** (author "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"`enoughpower`, version 0.1.x, with staging and commit features). This project is installed from the "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"Release archive above; `dsh-git-graph` is used here only as the DSH bundle row id and the package na"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"me inside this repository."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Check that `dsh-git-graph` is installed at version `0.6.1`:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Start DSH Web with `dsh web`, or restart your existing instance to load the plugin. For updates, run"},{"id":"p33s2","text":" `add` with the desired release tag, then restart that instance. Use the same profile name for insta"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"llation, startup, and removal."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"For 0.6.0, restart after updating so the Host and Client use the same strict data contract. Settings"},{"id":"p34s2","text":" previously saved separately for a subdirectory are not migrated to the worktree-root settings."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"For a custom profile, local `.tgz` installation, or source builds, see the development guide."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"1. Select a workspace in DSH Web and open the right sidebar.\n2. Select **dsh-git-graph** from the si"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"debar's start page.\n3. Select a commit for inline details, or a file for its diff. Select **Uncommit"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"ted Changes** to inspect working-tree changes.\n4. Choose **Compare commit…** and a base commit, then"},{"id":"p37s4","text":" select a changed file. In a historical file viewer, switch between **Diff** and **Full source**, an"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"d choose the old or new version."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Use **Settings** to adjust the display. Settings are saved separately for each repository."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Use the profile you installed into, and restart it after removal."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
